.TH koji-diff 1 2026-08-12 "sandogasa 0.19.3" "Sandogasa Manual"
.SH NAME
koji\-diff \- Koji build log differ — compare buildroot and build logs between two Koji builds
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBkoji\-diff\fR [\fB\-\-instance\fR] [\fB\-\-arch\fR] [\fB\-\-log\-lines\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-debug\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIREF1\fR> <\fIREF2\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Koji build log differ — compare buildroot and build logs between two Koji builds
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-instance\fR \fI<HOST>\fR
Koji instance hostname (required for bare IDs)
.TP
\fB\-\-arch\fR \fI<ARCH>\fR [default: x86_64]
Architecture to compare
.TP
\fB\-\-log\-lines\fR \fI<N>\fR [default: 50]
build.log tail lines on failure
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output as JSON
.TP
\fB\-\-debug\fR
Show debug info (log snippets, file listings)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
<\fIREF1\fR>
First build reference (Koji URL, build:<ID>, or task:<ID>)
.TP
<\fIREF2\fR>
Second build reference (Koji URL, build:<ID>, or task:<ID>)
